sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant ALB as Application Load Balancer
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant AUTH as Authentication Service
    participant SVC as Target Backend Service
    participant SEC as security-common

    B->>ALB: POST /api/auth/login
    ALB->>GW: Forward request
    GW->>AUTH: Route /api/auth/**
    AUTH->>AUTH: Authenticate credentials
    AUTH-->>B: Return JWT via Gateway and ALB

    B->>ALB: Subsequent API request + JWT
    ALB->>GW: Forward request
    GW->>SVC: Route to destination service
    SVC->>SEC: Validate JWT using shared library
    SEC-->>SVC: Validation result
    SVC-->>B: API response
